OL,3,AChristian festival 'devastated' after
OL,4,Aman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers of a Christian festival say
OL,7,Fthey are "devastated" after a sign fell
OL,8,Fat their event and injured seven
OL,9,Fpeople, with one man dying at the
OL,10,Fscene.
OL,12,FSussex Police said it had been called
OL,13,Fto the Big Church Festival at Wiston
OL,14,FPark, near Steyning in West Sussex, at
OL,15,Fabout 15:38 BST on Friday.
OL,17,FIt was later confirmed a 41-year-old
OL,18,Fman from Eastbourne in East Sussex had
OL,19,Fdied.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
