OL,3,AAt least 27 dead and hundreds evacuated
OL,4,Aafter strikes near Kyiv
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty-seven people have been killed in
OL,7,Fan overnight drone strike on the Kyiv
OL,8,Fregion, its governor has confirmed.
OL,10,FTymur Tkachenko said a further 42
OL,11,Fpeople, including four children, were
OL,12,Finjured in the Russian attack on the
OL,13,FBucha district. A further 381 people
OL,14,Fhave been evacuated.
OL,16,FSearch and rescue operations were
OL,17,Fongoing early on Saturday as emergency
OL,18,Fservices inspected buildings for
OL,19,Fdamage.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
